{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09908","headline":"送郭仆射节制劒南 · 岑参","name":"送郭仆射节制劒南","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"铁马擐红缨，幡旗出禁城。\n明王亲授钺，丞相欲专征。\n玉馔天厨送，金杯御酒倾。\n劒门乘嶮过，阁道踏空行。\n山鸟惊吹笛，江猿看洗兵。\n晓云随去阵，夜月逐行营。\n南仲今时往，西戎计日平。\n将心感知己，万里寄悬旌。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"岑参","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09908.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09908","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}